OL,3,ATeen boy rescued after days adrift in
OL,4,AAlaskan waters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has been rescued
OL,7,Fafter spending days sitting atop a boat
OL,8,Fthat had capsized in the frigid waters
OL,9,Fof Alaska's Bering Sea.
OL,11,FThe boy, identified by family members
OL,12,Fas Derek Parker Aghnaanga, was the lone
OL,13,Fsurvivor from the skiff, having lost
OL,14,Fhis older brother and cousin in the
OL,15,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
