OL,3,ATeen boy rescued after days adrift in
OL,4,AAlaskan waters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trio had departed from St Lawrence
OL,7,FIsland on Friday 4 September and were
OL,8,Fdue back the following Sunday
OL,9,Fafternoon, the US Coast Guard said. But
OL,10,Fwhen the 18-foot fishing vessel failed
OL,11,Fto return, they launched a search
OL,12,Feffort.
OL,14,FA Coast Guard aircrew located the boy
OL,15,Fsitting on top of the overturned boat
OL,16,Fon Monday morning, and a nearby good
OL,17,FSamaritan vessel pulled him to safety.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
